{
  "$comment": "Facebook's device-identifying fields (map 2026-10-30, sections 3-4) for scripts/observe_unlink.py. A key matches a captured path equal to it or ending in '.' + key. keys: the generated-identity keys the field derives from (config keys, or launch.window / launch.dpr); [] = no key varies it (the host's real value); null = unknown. leaves: step-2 leaf names, for settings/machine_constants.json and accepted_defaults.json. limits: owner-approved 'shared, as stock' rows, each with why and approved (UTC date). Network-quality estimates (ip_bound rtt/downlink) follow the connection like the IP. Vendor-level reasons only; check_privacy --file at every edit.",
